_🎯 Functional Correctness_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Canonicalize the start directory before parent traversal.**

If `start_dir` is a symlink to a repository subdirectory, `current.parent()` moves to the symlink parent instead of the repository parent. `find_project_root` then misses `.git` or `.jj`, and automatic worktree discovery does not run.

